      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Catching Lyova with the empty plate, Chef Barinov calmly asks how old their wealthy regular guest is compared to the young women he brings to dinner. To Lyova's horror, Barinov reveals that the 'secret ingredient' he mixes into that seafood salad is a crushed potency pill.",
